  "description": "By a strange twist of fate, Jin Yi Kwon, a photographer in need of a part-time assistant, ends up hiring Beom Jisoo, his first love. The two meet in a café after 13 years but instead of the tiny and adorable Beom Jisoo Jin Yi Kwon fell in love with, a muscular hunk shows up. Unlike Jin Yi Kwon who immediately recognizes Beom Jisoo, Beom Jisoo doesn’t seem to remember Jin Yi Kwon. What will happen to these two? Will Jin Lee Kwon finally confess his feelings towards Beom Jisoo after all these years?\n\n(Source: Pocket Comics)\n\n*Note: Includes 4 extra chapters.*",
